[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やったぞ、凛世！\r\nちょっと大きな仕事が入ったぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "008"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050010,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ありがとう、ございます\r\nとても……うれしく、思います",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "012",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これも、凛世のがんばりのおかげだ\r\n絶対成功させような",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050020,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……承知しております\r\n努力、いたします……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、その意気だ\r\n……ん？　どうした？　レッスンの予定が気になるのか？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……はい。ファンのみなさまの前で\r\n不格好な姿をお見せしたくなく……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "少しでも、レッスンができればと……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（凛世がファンのために……\r\nこの前の握手会からなんだか一皮むけたみたいだな）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、悪い悪い。ちょっと考えごとをしてた\r\nそれじゃ、さっそくレッスン室を手配しよう",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……あの、プロデューサーさま\r\nその前に、お話したいことが……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、何か相談か？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050070,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま、\r\n誠に申し訳ございません……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ど、どうしたんだ、急に？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050080,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世は、今まで……すべてをプロデューサーさまに、\r\n捧げるつもりでおりました……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050090,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "もちろん、その想いに……変わりはありません",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050100,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ですが、今は……\r\nファンのみなさまにも、同じことを思っているのです",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050110,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……\r\nこんな凛世を、お許しくださいますか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "凛世……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺のことは気にするな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "凛世は優しいな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "もちろんだ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、凛世にはむしろもっと大きな世界を見てほしい\r\nそれがきっと凛世の糧になる",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050120,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "そう、なのですね……\r\nプロデューサーさまが、お許しくださるので、あれば……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050130,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "これからはより一層、\r\nファンのみなさまに、寄り添いたく思います……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050140,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……ですが、一つだけ、お聞きください",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050150,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世は、これからもずっと……\r\nプロデューサーさまのことを、大切に想っております",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050160,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさまは、凛世にとって\r\n特別なお方なのですから……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050170,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "どうか、凛世が……\r\nこれからも貴方さまをお慕いすることを、お許しください",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "凛世……ああ、もちろんだ\r\n気にするなっていうのは、すまなかった",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "凛世が大切だと思うもの全部を大事にすればいい",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050180,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それを聞き……安心いたしました\r\nプロデューサーさま、いつまでも、貴方のお傍に……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050190,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "優しい、ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺のこともファンのことも\r\n両方気に掛けてくれてるんだろ？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050200,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それは……もちろんで、ございます",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だったら迷う必要なんかない。俺は凛世が\r\nファンのために頑張ろうとしているのは、嬉しいよ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに何より、凛世自身の気持ちを大事にしてほしい",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050210,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世の……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "誰かを気にする必要なんてないんだ\r\nもっと欲張りになれ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050220,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "欲張りに……",
    "charAnim2": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050230,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……凛世にとって、プロデューサーさまも\r\nファンのみなさまも、同じように大切なのです",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050240,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ふふ、これからは、凛世の望むまま……\r\nまっすぐに想いを伝えて参ります",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050240"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは凛世の成長の証だ\r\n広い世界に目を向けられるようになったってことなんだ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050250,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "世界……\r\n貴方さまと……離れ離れに、なるのでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうじゃない\r\n……俺が凛世に置いていかれないように、頑張るってことだ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050260,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさま……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、凛世がステージでたくさんの人に囲まれて\r\nそして、輝いていくのを見たくてスカウトしたんだ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから俺のことを気にして立ち止まるな\r\n俺は絶対、凛世の横にいるから",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050270,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……\r\n……凛世は……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050280,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世には……プロデューサーさまも、ファンのみなさまも、\r\n大切な……方々でございます",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。それでいい\r\n凛世の気持ちをもっと伝えていこう",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050290,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001050300,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "貴方さまにも、いつか……\r\n凛世の気持ちが……届きますよう……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200105/1012001050300"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]